<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβάπτιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαπτίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be dipped, that will not sink,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἅλμας,</span> of a net, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.80
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					811.26
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύπανον</span> trepan <i>with a
				guard, to stop it from going too deep,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.447
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not drenched with liquor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.686b
			</span></i>.</div>
